{"id": "EE_0021", "source": "5.18benchmark", "source_id": "EQ_1782", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "domain": "electrical_engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "某 380V 三相电缆线路给电动机供电,铜芯截面 A=35mm²、线路长 l=80m、20°C 时铜电阻率 ρ=0.0184Ω·mm²/m,工作电流 I=80A、cosφ=0.8。忽略电抗,按单相电阻压降往返计 ΔU=2·I·ρ·l/A·cosφ,求线路电压损失百分数 ΔU%(基准 380V)。", "options": ["A. 约 1.00%", "B. 约 1.42%", "C. 约 1.80%", "D. 约 2.00%"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "正确答案:约 1.42%。单根 R=ρl/A=0.0184×80/35=0.04206Ω;ΔU=2×80×0.04206×0.8=5.38V;ΔU%=5.38/380=1.42%。", "has_image": true, "images": ["EE_0021.png"], "metadata": {"year": "2017", "paper": "供配电_专业案例_上午", "original_file": "2017年电气工程师供配电专业案例考试真题上午卷.doc"}, "major_category": "power_equipment", "minor_category": "cable", "modified": "redone"}
{"id": "EE_0023", "source": "5.18benchmark", "source_id": "EQ_1785", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "domain": "electrical_engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "某 380V 三相电缆线路输送有功 P=60kW、cosφ=0.85,敷设方式校正系数 0.8。按经济电流密度法选型,铜芯经济电流密度 J=2.0A/mm²。所需电缆截面(mm²)约为多少?(先由 P 求 I,再 A=I/(J·k))", "options": ["A. 约 50mm²(选 50)", "B. 约 67mm²(选 70)", "C. 约 95mm²(选 95)", "D. 约 43mm²(选 35)"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "正确答案:约 67mm²(选 70mm²);由 I=P/(√3·U·cosφ)=60000/(1.732×380×0.85)=107.3A,A=I/(J·k)=107.3/(2.0×0.8)=67.0mm²,取标称 70mm²。。I=P/(√3·U·cosφ)=60000/(1.732×380×0.85)=60000/559.3=107.3A;A=107.3/(2.0×0.8)=67.1mm²,选标称 70mm²。", "has_image": true, "images": ["EE_0023.png"], "metadata": {"year": "2017", "paper": "供配电_专业案例_上午", "original_file": "2017年电气工程师供配电专业案例考试真题上午卷.doc"}, "major_category": "power_equipment", "minor_category": "cable", "modified": "redone"}
